            <div class="card-body"><div class="tag">Island days · 05 min read</div><h3>Golem Grad: the lake's wild heart</h3><p>Standing on Lake Prespa, Golem Grad appears as a bright rampart of limestone and old juniper. Take the boat out early and discover the island's wild heart.</p><a class="read" href="#golem-grad-wild-heart">Read the story <b>→</b></a></div>
